OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fmostly clear night with the wind
OL,7,Fgradually easing to a light breeze.
OL,8,FFeeling chilly as temperatures drop to
OL,9,Fsingle figures. Mist or fog patches
OL,10,Fand a grass frost are likely in rural
OL,11,Fareas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FMist or fog patches should
OL,14,Fsoon clear. A fine day with light
OL,15,Fwinds and long sunny spells to follow,
OL,16,Fperhaps hazy at times. Feeling warm in
OL,17,Fplaces by the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
