OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fand rather cloudy on Tuesday with a
OL,7,Fwarm night. Rain, heavy at times,
OL,8,Ffollowed by a brighter evening
OL,9,FWednesday. Settled and dry on
OL,10,FThursday. Daytime temperatures
OL,11,Fremaining above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
